        "ar": "وَكَيْفَ حَالُكِ أَنْتِ؟",
        "en": "And how are you?",
        "gender": "f",
        "hint": "to a woman",
        "au": "1_1b_anti.mp3",
        "notes": "The word 'أَنْتِ' (anti) means 'you' for a woman (compared to 'أَنْتَ' / anta for a man)."
      },
      {
